# Locations feed (JSON or CSV). Default is the committed live snapshot in /public.
# To refresh from the partner sheet later, replace public/locations.json or point
# this URL at a CORS-enabled JSON/CSV export. Raw Google /export?format=csv
# URLs usually fail CORS in the browser.
#
# VITE_LOCATIONS_URL=/locations.json
# VITE_LOCATIONS_URL=/locations.csv
# VITE_LOCATIONS_URL=https://opensheet.elk.sh/SPREADSHEET_ID/Locations
